  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Exclusive collaboration between Nike and Drake’s NOCTA label\nLegendary Nike AF1 silhouette with elevated detailing\nTumbled leather on the upper for a premium vibe\nSwooshes on the sides with detailed stitching showcase the craftsmanship\nNike Air and NOCTA trident logo embroidery on the heels\nLace closure with AF1 hardware for a classic, secure fit\nNike Air in the midsole for lightweight comfort and impact protection\nNike AF1 and NOCTA logos on the heel for a polished look\n\"Love you forever\" inscribed on the midsole with a translucent finish\nSemi-translucent rubber outsole with hearts and a pivot-circle pattern\nSpecial-edition box and packaging complete the collab\nThe Nike NOCTA Air Force 1 Low is imported.\nThe most legendary silhouette in sneaker culture meets one of music’s most transformative artists with the Men's Nike NOCTA Air Force 1 Low Casual Shoes. This exclusive collaboration combines classic Air Force 1 heritage with Drake's vision for elevated style, featuring premium craftsmanship and luxurious details that command attention. With the heartfelt \"Love You Forever\" inscription on the midsole, signature NOCTA logos, and special-edition packaging, every element has been carefully constructed for a pair that, like Drake's endless list of hits, is destined for heavy play in your rotation.﻿</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike NOCTA Air Force 1 Low Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Cobalt Tint/Metallic Silver</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3411839</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Adult - Men's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official Nike footwear size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 41</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 42</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 9.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 42.5</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 9.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;